# __NAME__

Bun workspace. Packages live under `packages/`; the root holds one lockfile and one toolchain choice.

## Commands

- Install: `__PACKAGE_MANAGER__ install`
- Test: `bun test`
- Typecheck: `bun run typecheck` (typechecker `__TYPECHECKER__`)
- Lint: `bun run lint` (linter `__LINTER__`)
- Format: `bun run format` (formatter `__FORMATTER__`)

`jyz.config.toml` at the root sets the toolchain for every member; a member overrides it only when it differs. Tabs at 4 wide, printWidth 100.
